ur Bill Related Links Adult / Part-time Students Veterans International Students Transfer Students Virtual Tour Research Arrow left icon Back Research at Fordham Faculty Research Student Research Digital Humanities Journals Published at Fordham Research Resources Office of Research Office of Sponsored Programs Institutional Review Board Libraries Quick Links Centers and Institutes Louis Calder Center Biological Field Station NYC Research Partners Related Links Research News Calder Center NYC Partners Libraries Student Life Arrow left icon Back Campus Culture Living on Campus Dining and Ram Hospitality Safety, Health, and Wellness Multicultural Affairs Public Safety Services Commuter Services Disability Services Career Resources Transportation Get Involved Events and Activities Student Involvement Student Organizations Quicklinks Student Handbook Bookstore Deans of Students and Student Life Division of Student Affairs Related Links Bookstore Commuter Services Residential Life Dining Student Handbook Resources Arrow left icon Back Resources Libraries Information Technology Human Resources Administrative Offices Hidden Public Safety WFUV Fordham University Press Fordham Antiquities Museum Hidden Log In Fordham News Policies Consumer Information Related Links Academic Calendar Jobs at Fordham Athletics Arrow left icon Back Athletics Varsity Sports Club Sports Hidden Intramurals Athletics Facilities Related Links Tickets Maroon Club Varsity Sports Fitness and Recreation Tickets Information for Arrow left icon Back Current Students Faculty and Staff Families Alumni Find a Degree Find People Apply Visit Give News Log in Search icon Search Menu Search the site Search icon Close icon Office of the Provost Arrow up icon Hide Fordham Menu Menu for Office of the Provost Arrow down icon About Us Meet the Provost Staff Directory Our Work Provost Office Units Gainful Employment Disclosure Contact Us Academic Organization Colleges and Schools Faculty of Arts and Sciences Centers and Institutes Academic Deans Provost Office Units Corporate Relations Office Faculty Affairs Fordham University Libraries Fordham University Press Institutional Research and Assessment Office of Equity, Inclusion, and Opportunity Office of Fellowship Advising Online Learning Office of Student Success Research WFUV Faculty Resources Academic Conferences In this Section Faculty Affairs Our Faculty Reappointment, Tenure & Promotion Policies Forms and Workflows New Faculty Orientation & Resources Faculty Opportunities Faculty Activity Reporting Information for Non-Tenure Track Faculty COACHE Interfolio Home About Leadership and Administration Administrative Offices Office of the Provost Provost Office Units Faculty Affairs Faculty Activity Reporting Faculty Activity Reporting Faculty Activity Reporting System Faculty 180 is the University’s online database hosted by a company called Interfolio. It is used for collecting, storing, and reporting on data about the professional activity of the University’s faculty. It is more commonly known as the faculty activity reporting (FAR) system. The types of activity for which information is collected include teaching, research, grant applications and awards, professional service, professional development activities, service to the University, college, and department, honors and awards, and publications. Most of your scheduled teaching data is uploaded automatically into the system. Faculty 180 will generate Activity Reports that can be used to complete some of the sections for Review, Reappointment, Tenure, and Promotion. You also have the option to create customized vitas using preset templates or by selecting from various available formats. The Faculty 180 FAR system is available all year, and we encourage you to keep your data up to date. At a minimum, you should update your information each year by February 1st so we can generate your annual faculty activity report. We also recommend a second update in June since data in the system is used for the Annual reports for each school and for the President's Fall letter to the university describing faculty accomplishments. To access the Faculty Activity Report System, log in to My-Pages , then select the \"My Apps\" tab. Scroll to the bottom of the screen and click on the Interfolio link (located on the left-hand channel). You will see the link to the reporting system on the left-hand side once you are brought into Interfolio. You can click on Profile and Activities to make any necessary updates/corrections. For additional support or guidance, please refer to the resources below: Dossier Support Email: [email protected] Phone: 877-997-8807 Institutional Support Email: [email protected] Phone: +1 833-844-2118 Monday through Friday, 9:00 a.m. – 6:00 p.m. Eastern Time (US) eLearning: Interfolio Faculty Activity Reporting (F180) Course for Faculty Users Faculty 180 Guides (Login required) Explore our programs › Visit us › Apply now › More on social media Helpful Links University Directory Careers at Fordham Nondiscrimination Policy Accessibility Privacy Policy Visit Campus Tours Maps and Directions Virtual Tour"
    },
